DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250515
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250516
SUMMARY:New Jersey: State corporate income/franchise tax return due
DESCRIPTION:CBT-100 due date is the 15th day of the month following the fed
 eral corporate return's original due date (May 15 for calendar year\, not t
 he standard 15th-of-4th-month rule)\; automatic 6-month extension via Form 
 CBT-200-T conditioned on having paid 90%+ of tax liability by the original 
 due date. | CBT-100 due date is the 15th day of the month following the fed
 eral corporate return's original due date (May 15 for calendar year\, not t
