SUMMARY:New Jersey: NJ-1065 (partnership) / CBT-100S (S-corp) due
DESCRIPTION:New Jersey partnership return due the 15th day of the 4th month
  after year-end. NJ's BAIT (Business Alternative Income Tax\, an elective P
 TE tax) is a separate regime with its own mechanics. | New Jersey partnersh
 ip return due the 15th day of the 4th month after year-end. NJ's BAIT (Busi
 ness Alternative Income Tax\, an elective PTE tax) is a separate regime wit
 h its own mechanics. File Form PART-200-T by the original due date with 80%
  of the filing fee paid\; not automatic if requirements aren't met. | Autho
 rity: New Jersey Division of Taxation\, direct fetch this session: "five-mo
 nth extension of time to file an NJ-1065"\; extension denied if the 80% pay
 ment requirement is not met or not filed timely. | Source: https://www.nj.g
 ov/treasury/taxation/pdf/current/part/part200t-cbt206.pdf | This date is co
 mputed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-announced change\
 ; confirm against the cited source before relying on it.
