DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20250430
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20250501
SUMMARY:New Jersey: State unemployment insurance quarterly return due
DESCRIPTION:30th day of the month following the close of the calendar quart
 er (deviates from the standard last-day-of-month pattern) | Q1 2026 (Jan-Ma
 r) state unemployment insurance quarterly report and payment. DEVIATES from
  the standard pattern: the NJ-927 and WR-30\, and any remittance due\, must
  be received no later than the 30th day of the month after the close of the
  quarter (not the last day - differs from the standard pattern in 3 of 4 qu
 arters since April has 30 days but July/October/January do not). | Authorit
